==Battleground==
*1 [[Haniwanwan]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>, delay 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is literally just a Puffington with a bunch of Sir Rels. Spam your Area Attackers and you win, as well as your anti-Relic Ubers/UL Legends that you brought along.

